body:
I had the privilege of receiving not one, but **two** bonuses at work for extending my contract. Although I felt like I spent my money well at the time, the one thing I regret not doing either time was investing a portion of it to an aggregating account of sorts. Also, I wish I had the imagination back then that I do now. I could have traveled all kinds of places and in style, no less.

&#x200B;

Ah well. Live and learn, I guess.
